        "text": "Keep one sound tool carried or equipped. In your pack, choose the prepared material, then its cutting action. \nExamples:\n1 cured harness-leather offcut -> 1 leather binding\n1 knotflax cord + 1 leather binding -> 1 guard lashing\n1 knotflax cord + 2 spurgrass spine -> 1 serrated edge kit\nNeeds: compatible prepared stock and the exact extra inputs shown in the material's preview.\nCost and limits: Each preparation spends its materials and one action; the tool is kept. The material preview states the output and discarded trimming. Flexible workshop stock and purchased components remain useful alternatives.\nRight now: choose a prepared material in your pack to see its cutting actions and exact requirements."
